          "Agreeing the analysis plan before fieldwork is one of the most underrated steps. It forces everyone to think about which comparisons matter, which sub-groups need enough interviews to be reported separately, and what success looks like. It also prevents the frustrating moment when a stakeholder asks for a cut of the data that the sample cannot support.",
