          "The right response starts with understanding exactly what is being asked, reconciling the figures for the period, gathering invoices and supporting documents, and replying clearly and on time through the portal. If the department is right, paying the difference with interest promptly usually limits further consequences. If it is wrong, a well-documented reply often resolves the matter. Our team supports clients with replies and, where needed, works with their chartered accountant on further proceedings.",
