          "A brand with a ₹1,200 average order, 50% gross margin and frequent repeat purchases can invest far more in acquisition than one with a ₹600 order, 30% margin and one-time buyers. Our [performance marketing guide](/blog/performance-marketing-guide) explains CAC, ROAS and lifetime value in more detail.",
