          "The point is not to assign blame but to learn and decide. Large or persistent variances may mean assumptions need updating, actions are needed, or the plan itself should change. Our [MIS & financial reporting guide](/blog/mis-financial-reporting-guide) explains how variances are presented in monthly packs.",
