          "Adding a fixed percentage to last year without thinking",
          "Ignoring cash flow and working capital",
          "Overly optimistic revenue with no downside scenario",
          "Budgets prepared once and never revisited",
          "Variance reviews that explain but never decide",
          "Complex models nobody else understands",
