          "Frequent Research runs its own consumer communities, [Turn2Opinion](/portals/turn2opinion) and [MyFrequentRewards](/portals/myfrequentrewards). Members register free, verify their email and phone number, complete profile surveys, and receive invitations matched to their profile. Running our own panels means we control recruitment, verification and quality scoring rather than relying entirely on third parties.",
